{
  "info": {
    "name": "OLT Gateway Read-Only MVP",
    "description": "Colección read-only del módulo olt-gateway (Huawei MA5608T).\n\nAuth: header X-Olt-Gateway-Key (excepto /health).\n\nOLT live (dev):\n- Usuario SSH: oltadmin (Reenter 4)\n- Env: OLT_GATEWAY_USER=oltadmin OLT_GATEWAY_PASSWORD=... OLT_GATEWAY_MOCK_ENABLED=false\n- Variables sn/slot/port/ontId de ejemplo son del mock; en live ajustar con datos reales de /onus o /onus/autofind.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/ispadmin"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "dev-olt-gateway-key"
    },
    {
      "key": "sn",
      "value": "ZTEGDC47DF15"
    },
    {
      "key": "slot",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "port",
      "value": "0"
    },
    {
      "key": "ontId",
      "value": "5"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "OLT Info",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/olt/info"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ONUs Autofind (SmartOLT compat)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/onus/autofind"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ONU by SN (SmartOLT compat)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/onus/by-sn/{{sn}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ONUs Summary",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/onus"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ONU Detail",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/onus/{{slot}}/{{port}}/{{ontId}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ONU Optical",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Olt-Gateway-Key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/olt-gateway/onus/{{slot}}/{{port}}/{{ontId}}/optical"
      }
    }
  ]
}
